LE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":3996358090,"text":"うちはもうちょいここに残るわ、心の花火大会がまだ終わってへんのや。","nextNodeIds":[120140102]},{"nodeId":120140102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":2410550458,"text":"まぁせやけど、もっとお喋りしたいっちゅうなら付き合うてもええで。","nextNodeIds":[120140103,120140108,120140115]},{"nodeId":120140103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2674832570,"text":"この後は何をするの？","nextNodeIds":[120140104]},{"nodeId":120140104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":2979679378,"text":"子供たちと一緒に「袋貉」を探すかな、待たせてもうとるし、宵宮姉さんが約束を破るわけにもいかんやろ。","nextNodeIds":[120140105]},{"nodeId":120140105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":150449954,"text":"あと、花火大会の感想をみんなから聞かんとな。","nextNodeIds":[120140106]},{"nodeId":120140106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":1853463090,"text":"これから先も、きっと世話になるやろうし。","nextNodeIds":[120140107]},{"nodeId":120140107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":2964349754,"text":"それとあんたとパイモンちゃんにも、世話になったな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":120140108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2732609802,"text":"花火代って高い？","nextNodeIds":[120140109]},{"nodeId":120140109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":3914132866,"text":"あんたらなら…","nextNodeIds":[120140110]},{"nodeId":120140110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":1603347538,"text":"タダでええよ！","nextNodeIds":[120140111]},{"nodeId":120140111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":1564927346,"text":"元々うちが押し付けたもんやし、散々迷惑かけといてモラを払えなんて言われへんよ、ははっ。","nextNodeIds":[120140112]},{"nodeId":120140112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":277202938,"text":"悪いし、遠慮するよ。","nextNodeIds":[120140113]},{"nodeId":120140113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":1410313578,"text":"#気にせんといてぇな、水臭いなぁもう。せや、等価交換や！あんたが家族を見つけたら、{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYA|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTER]}さんに「長野原花火屋」を紹介してくれへんか。そしたら、うちもお客さんが一人増えるやろ。","nextNodeIds":[120140114]},{"nodeId":120140114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":264394610,"text":"#うちもいつか、{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYA|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTER]}さんに会うてみたいなぁ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":120140115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":237810258,"text":"もし天領奉行がまた嫌がらせに来たら…","nextNodeIds":[120140116]},{"nodeId":120140116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":3911106858,"text":"もういっぺん、しばいたる！","nextNodeIds":[120140117]},{"nodeId":120140117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":3997151090,"text":"——ははははっ、冗談や冗談。前に言うたやろ、うちは奉行の人たちと付き合いがあるって。","nextNodeIds":[120140118]},{"nodeId":120140118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":2829813130,"text":"詫びを入れて、罰金を払えば何とかなるやろ。","nextNodeIds":[120140119]},{"nodeId":120140119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1035,"speakerName":"宵宮","textMapHash":2631596474,"text":"あんたらこそ気ぃ付けや。次こないなことがあっても、うちみたいに無鉄砲になったらあかんで、ひひっ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1201401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,40],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q12013_Yoimiya_Finial_Pos"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE"